{"id": "68524", "title": "竹叶坏人心", "author": "维生素ABC", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68524.htm", "intro": "文名取自一首越人歌里的两句：竹叶坏水色，郎亦坏人心\r\n\r\n剧场版文案：\r\n婚后某天，竺叶突然想起很早以前去庙里求的一支签，解签文的大师说她这一生有两个好归宿。\r\n\r\n便洋洋得意的跑进浴室跟正在泡澡的人炫耀：“哼哼，大师说了，你在不对我好点，就是离婚了我还是能找着第二春的！”\r\n\r\n李君城淡淡挑眉，长臂一捞，将人困住：“你理解错了，大师的意思的确是你有两处归宿，不过一处是我怀里……另一处，是我心里。”\r\n\r\n一场妖精大战之后竺叶才有空泪流满面一下，大师，您千算万算木算到我这一下手就遇上了个千年禽兽啊~~o(>_", "base": "files/article/html/68/68524", "chapters": [{"title": "零一章", "file": "10534092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零二章", "file": "10534093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零三章", "file": "10534094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零四章", "file": "10534095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零五章", "file": "10534096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零六章", "file": "10534097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零七章", "file": "10534098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零八章", "file": "10534099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "零九章", "file": "10534100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一零章", "file": "10534101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一一章", "file": "10534102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一二章", "file": "10534103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一三章", "file": "10534104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一四章", "file": "10534105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一五章", "file": "10534106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一六章", "file": "10534107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一七章", "file": "10534108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一八章", "file": "10534109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一九章", "file": "10534110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二零章", "file": "10534111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二一章", "file": "10534112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-28", "file": "10534113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-33", "file": "10534114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34-39", "file": "1